    "name": "RoutineMate API",
    "description": "MVP-1 backend for RoutineMate \u2014 Node.js + TypeScript + Express + Sequelize (MySQL). See docs/RoutineMate-MVP1-Database-Design.html in the repo for the full schema and API-to-table mapping this collection exercises.\n\nWorkflow: run Auth > Register (or Login) first \u2014 its test script saves {{accessToken}} to the environment automatically. Every other request uses that token via the collection-level Bearer auth.",
